TITLE Calcite kinetics with Cu and Ba, pH 2, 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu   10
    Ba   5
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals C Cu
END
